WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.192
The applied challenge asks you to reshape long sales data into one row per product.

00:00:06.192 --> 00:00:09.567
Create separate January, February, and March revenue columns.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:18.462
Preserve null when there is no observation for a product and month unless the business meaning clearly says that missing

00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:26.817
should be zero. Before writing the query, state the output grain and the measure that belongs in each pivot cell.
